{"id": 125, "name": "Zhuxin", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_8991b456c4482e7170422f3d77d16b00.png", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Damage", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "30", "stats": ["40", "80", "80", "30"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "A mysterious young woman who guides the ember butterflies using her Lantern of Spirits.", "skills": [{"name": "Crimson Butterflies", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_43020fccd51aa7420c2c8b76a2cdb4fe.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Every time Zhuxin channels <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lantern Flare</span>, she converts the Mana spent into up to 15 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crimson Butterflies</span> to follow her <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spirit Lantern</span>. After Zhuxin stops channeling <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lantern Flare</span>, the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crimson Butterflies</span> will gradually disappear, each restoring 3% of her Max Mana.\nZhuxin has a naturally high base Max Mana, but it doesn't scale with her level."}, {"name": "Fluttering Grace", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_155343c85c52dfccbf7697d353e115bd.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 100", "desc": "Zhuxin deals 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemies in a fan-shaped area and applies 1 stack(s) of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Snare</span>. Zhuxin also slows all enemy heroes hit by 20% and gains 20% of extra Movement Speed herself for 1.5s."}, {"name": "Lantern Flare", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_0eb6ec4236fd89a8ea6041edf0868569.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 0.5", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Hold</span>: Hold the skill button to move the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spirit Lantern</span>. It deals 35<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemies in range every 0.33s (Magic Bonus increases to 60% against minions) and applies <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Snare</span> to enemy heroes hit. When an enemy hero reaches 10 stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Snare</span>, the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crimson Butterflies</span> capture them, pulling them airborne for 1s.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Release</span>: Throw all captured enemies to the target location, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> (+ 10% captured target's Max HP) <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to all enemies in the area. If an enemy is hit multiple times, subsequent damage decays by 80%.\n\nAfter a target is captured, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Snare</span> cannot stack on them again for 4s. During this time, this skill deals 15% extra damage to that target."}, {"name": "Crimson Beacon", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a6ca23dff19dee8f2f26740ce29b47a9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 60   Mana Cost: 200", "desc": "Zhuxin blinks to the target location, gaining a 400<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> shield and creating a field for 6s. The field deals 30<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and applies 1 stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Soul Snare</span> to nearby enemies every 0.5s."}], "builds":